(
    title: "Checkers",
    description: Some("Rules-enforced checkers against the Activision computer at three strengths, or head-to-head: you steer a flashing X to pick pieces up and set them down, forced jumps are compulsory, and kings stack two checkers high. The screen goes blank while the computer thinks — seconds at novice, minutes per move at expert, where a game can run past two hours."),
